UPDATES={13: {'interactive': 'descent', 'titleZh': '梯度下降', 'textExcerpt': False, 'text': 'Gradient descent: learn by taking a step\n梯度下降：沿着坡度，一步步学习\nL(w) = ½(w − 1)²; g = w − 1; w′ = w − ηg\nRead the slope, calculate the update, then measure the new loss.\n先看坡度，再计算参数改变量，更新后再计算损失。\nPause, step, reset, and compare learning rates from the same starting point.\n可以暂停、单步、重置，从同一起点比较不同步长系数。\nA one-parameter convex teaching model, not a complete neural-network loss landscape.\n这是单参数凸函数教学模型，不是真实网络的完整损失地形。'}, 21: {'interactive': 'tokens', 'titleZh': '词元的语义星云', 'textExcerpt': False, 'text': 'A Galaxy of Tokens\n词元的语义星云\nSeven context stories, automatically switching every fourteen seconds. Pause and switch meanings to explore.\n每十四秒切换一组语境；可以暂停，手动切换词义。\nRelated words and English, Chinese, French and Spanish equivalents occupy shared semantic regions.\n关联词与英、中、法、西班牙语词语共同组成语义星云。\nWatch a contextual representation move between meanings: bank, light, flower / spend, mouse.\n观察语境化表示在不同含义之间移动：河岸／银行、光／轻、花朵／花钱、老鼠／鼠标。\nSynthetic 8D contextual states projected into 3D; paths are illustrative, not model traces. Word labels may contain several tokens.\n合成八维语境状态的三维投影，移动路径为教学示意；词语可能包含多个词元。\nSeven cases: bank, light, flower / spend, mouse, date, avocat.\n七组例子：河岸／银行、光／轻、花朵／花钱、老鼠／鼠标、约会／椰枣、律师／牛油果。\nI brought a date to dinner.\n我带了约会对象来吃晚餐。／我带了一颗椰枣来吃晚餐。\nJ’ai mangé mon avocat.\n我吃了我的牛油果。／我把我的律师吃了。\nThe camera follows the light between two highlighted semantic clouds. Switch meaning manually or play the fourteen-second tour.\n镜头沿光流穿行于两团提亮的语义词云；可以手动切换词义，或每十四秒自动轮播。\nHold at the source for 3 seconds, travel smoothly for 6 seconds, then hold at the destination for 5 seconds.\n起点停留三秒，平滑移动六秒，到达后停留五秒。\nOn entry, show the whole galaxy for 12 seconds, then approach bank. Subsequent loops keep the close view; re-entering the slide restarts the overview.\n进入本页先展示十二秒星云全景，再靠近 bank 开始轮播；循环播放不重复全景，重新进入本页才重播开场。\nSeven examples, including Urdu kal: yesterday / tomorrow.\n七组例子，包括乌尔都语 kal：昨天／明天。\nکل امتحان تھا۔ / کل امتحان ہو گا۔\n考试在昨天。／考试将在明天。\nہم کل کا کام کل کریں گے۔\n我们把 kal 的工作留到 kal 做：昨天的工作明天做，或明天的工作明天做。'}}
